    "public": false,
    "description": {
      "format": "markdown",
      "raw": "Build a scalable, resilient distributed queue management system with multi-agent support. Phases: (1) Foundation: core queue manager, error handling, agent registry. (2) Advanced Routing: intelligent job routing, prioritization, performance tracking. (3) Distributed Infrastructure: persistence, cross-node coordination, exactly-once processing. (4) Advanced Features: ML optimization, observability, security. Next steps: finalize specs, set up env, PoC, start Phase 1.",
